+# Compact class and ER presentation attribution
+
+The opt-in compartment geometry and drawing algorithms in
+`src/class/presentation.rs`, `src/er/presentation.rs`, and their corresponding
+SVG painters are adapted from beautiful-mermaid 1.1.3's `src/class/{layout,renderer}.ts`
+and `src/er/{layout,renderer}.ts`. The existing Merman graph engines continue to
+position nodes and route relationships; no ELK.js implementation is copied.
+The public profile is selected through MermaidConfig's serde JSON values with
+`class.presentationProfile: "compact"` and `er.presentationProfile: "compact"`.
